        "Configure and verify a cloud provider adapter, provider credentials and a positive enforced model budget.",
        "Explicitly enable the requested capability and satisfy existing provider/budget guards; a profile or JSON switch alone does not activate services.",
        "A compact database and source-link storage policy are required independently of inference."
      ]
    }
